'''Arcanine''' (Japanese: '''ウインディ''' ''Windie'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

