==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's uncommon print illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Arcanine|33}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion, and the {{TCGP|Promo-B}} print illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Supreme Victors|Arcanine|50}} from the {{TCG|Supreme Victors}} expansion.
*{{m|Fire Fang}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Arcanine}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

